Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "aluvabroadband@gmail.com",
  "password": "Abcpl@#2025"
}

### ✅ Login (Obtain Access & Refresh Tokens)---for admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "abc@gmail.com",
  "password": "Password@123"
}

