# --------------------FORGOT PASSWORD--------------



### Send OTP
POST {{baseUrl}}/forgot-password/send-otp/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "abcd@gmail.com"
}

### Verify OTP
POST {{baseUrl}}/forgot-password/verify-otp/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "abcd@gmail.com",
  "otp": "477360"
}

### Reset Password
POST {{baseUrl}}/forgot-password/reset-password/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "abcd@gmail.com",
  "new_password": "123",
  "confirm_password": "123"
}
